## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- .NET 10 SDK

### Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

### Run Tests

```bash
dotnet test
```

### Local Development

You can test the skill manually by piping JSON to stdin:

```bash
echo '{"tool": "hello.greet", "parameters": {"name": "World"}}' | dotnet run
```

Expected output:
```json
{"success":true,"result":"Hello, World! Welcome to {{name}}."}
```

